{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discard</strong> - it is a sci-fi puzzle 2D-platformer inspired by old-school cinematic platformers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must solve problems in order to survive on this dangerous planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/9430cc05a7fe3d54ab36dd6cba758892.poster.avif?t=1763386732\" width=854 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/9430cc05a7fe3d54ab36dd6cba758892.webm?t=1763386732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/9430cc05a7fe3d54ab36dd6cba758892.mp4?t=1763386732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Discover new areas to explore and secrets to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Solve puzzles to escape. One wrong move could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/64672a02000b995e9f36df0ce2302d6d.poster.avif?t=1763386732\" width=854 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/64672a02000b995e9f36df0ce2302d6d.webm?t=1763386732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/64672a02000b995e9f36df0ce2302d6d.mp4?t=1763386732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 A World Alive with Danger: Explore diverse zones, from underground labs to deser